  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1CGxas2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1185\" height=\"999\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>📘：總覽</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Overweight Farming 是一個小型模組，旨在改善並擴展 Minecraft 的農耕系統，讓種植變得更有趣。此模組的主要特色是「巨型作物」，原版作物有極低機率生長成這種作物。</span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.akliz.net%252fgalena\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://imgur.com/IISinGC.png\" width=\"640\" height=\"150\"></a></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/uafwrgf.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"963\" height=\"963\"></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/L3BVBqd.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"985\" height=\"985\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vQEMMqS.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"986\" height=\"987\"></p>\n</div><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>📦：稻草帽</strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/942654912054063104/962321997847756830/unknown.png\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/942654912054063104/962322031276347482/unknown.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1158\" height=\"1158\"></p>\n</div><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>📦：剝皮更新</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/395717650509987874/975749534158307378/OF7.png?width=676&amp;height=676\" alt=\"\" width=\"676\" height=\"676\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/780406367264440342/975745533069119519/OF8.png?width=676&amp;height=676\" alt=\"\" width=\"676\" height=\"676\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/780406367264440342/975745533555671050/OF9.png?width=676&amp;height=676\" alt=\"\" width=\"676\" height=\"676\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/780406367264440342/975745534264479764/OF10.png?width=676&amp;height=676\" alt=\"\" width=\"676\" height=\"676\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/780406367264440342/975745534583271494/OF11.png?width=676&amp;height=676\" alt=\"\" width=\"676\" height=\"676\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/780406367264440342/975745535828975696/OF12.png?width=676&amp;height=676\" alt=\"\" width=\"676\" height=\"676\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>📦相容性/好朋友 :D</strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>巨型洋蔥</strong>和<strong>巨型高麗菜</strong>來自<strong>Farmer's Delight</strong>！</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/25VHqui.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"536\" height=\"536\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>巨型大蒜</strong>、<strong>巨型曼德拉草</strong>和<strong>巨型血根草</strong>適用於<strong>Bewitchment</strong>！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/pDs3Tev.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"669\" height=\"354\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>巨型生薑</strong>適用於<strong>Snowy Spirit</strong>！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/780406367264440342/975511442583339088/unknown.png?width=720&amp;height=672\" alt=\"\" width=\"582\" height=\"543\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>巨型奇異果</strong>來自<strong>Hedgehogs mod</strong>！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/780406367264440342/975511442222645298/unknown.png?width=676&amp;height=676\" alt=\"\" width=\"556\" height=\"556\"></strong></p>\n</div><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">🔧&nbsp;<strong>團隊成員：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>材質美術師：<a href=\"https://mobile.twitter.com/Steamcyber68\" rel=\"nofollow\">Steam</a> 和 <a href=\"https://mobile.twitter.com/Binome__\" rel=\"nofollow\">Binome</a></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>主要程式設計師：<a href=\"https://twitter.com/orcinuswastaken\" rel=\"nofollow\">Orcinus</a></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Fabric 移植者：<a href=\"https://github.com/mrsterner\" rel=\"nofollow\">MrSterner</a>&nbsp;</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>📝 備註：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">如果您對新功能或與您喜愛的模組相容有任何建議，歡迎加入<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fsA858vGruu\" rel=\"nofollow\">我們的 Discord 伺服器</a>！</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3>🧰&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:24px\">模組包設計者</span>：</strong></span></h3><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">您可以將此模組放入您的模組包中，但請記得標註我們！:)</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>",
